correction('P000337','positive definiteness','Nonnegative D and nonnegative Schur complement imply positive definiteness.','For strict positivity require Hermitian symmetry, D>0, and strictly positive Schur complement. Semidefinite and singular cases have separate conditions.','P000337 scan and block congruence; item 1970-216.2.')
correction('P000339','lens-space complex','The complex is acyclic without stating the twist.','The complex becomes acyclic after a nontrivial character twist; the untwisted universal cover retains ordinary homology.','P000339 scan and Milnor Section 12.')
