correction('P000341-P000342','KdV equation and Hamiltonian','u_t+2u_xxx+6u u_x=0 together with Q=integral(u^3+u_x^2).','With J=partial_x the displayed Q yields u_t=6u u_x-2u_xxx. A standard coherent normalization uses H=integral(u^3+u_x^2/2), giving u_t=6u u_x-u_xxx.','Direct variation of Q; Zakharov--Faddeev equations (1), (6)--(7).')
correction('P000342-P000343','scattering angle','Argument of the reflection coefficient as the canonical angle, without convention changes.','The cited published canonical pair uses arg b(k), while the physical reflection coefficient is b(k)/a(k); do not identify these phases without the corresponding transformation.','Zakharov--Faddeev equation (23), p.285.',kind='ambiguity')
correction('P000344','unitarity of scattering','Scattering amplitude is unitary.','The full scattering operator on the energy sphere, including its identity term and normalization, is unitary. The amplitude alone is not.','Faddeev 1966 equations (5)--(8).')
correction('P000345','tube notation','Full neighborhood T_epsilon(Gamma) and ambiguous n/m index.','Use the normal circle bundle over gamma in V; for n=2m intersect V with P^{m+1}.','P000345 argument and its repeated exact-sequence formulation on P000347--348.',kind='ambiguity')
