correction('P000349','Palamodov two-equation example','D_x u=f, (D_y+lambda)u=g imply u=D_y g-D_x f.','For constant lambda the compatibility is D_x g-D_y f=lambda f, and it does not determine u. The intended example is unidentified.','P000349 scan confirms lambda; direct commuting-derivative calculation. The alternative coefficient x in the commentary is explicitly editorial.')
correction('P000350','weighted shift space','ell^p without an index range.','1 <= p < infinity, or c_0; ell^infinity is nonseparable and cannot have a countable dense orbit.','Rolewicz example and separability.',kind='ambiguity')
correction('P000351','stable invariants','Stably only rank and signature remain.','Specify stabilization: adding even hyperbolic planes preserves parity; adding the same odd indefinite plane makes the equal-rank/signature forms isometric.','Unimodular classification; the handwritten disagreement does not specify the intended stabilization.',kind='ambiguity')
correction('P000352','sheaf valued in arbitrary category K','Exact-sequence notation starting with 0.','Use an equalizer in a category with the needed limits; use 0 and a difference map only for the abelian formulation.','Sheaf equalizer axiom; Stacks Tag 00VM.',kind='ambiguity')
correction('P000353','Lie-group site morphisms','Every morphism is a regular equivariant map with surjective derivative.','All smooth equivariant maps are morphisms; jointly surjective families of submersions are covers.','Geronimus Section 3.1, full Russian primary article; scan confirms the notebook wording.')
